      "locked": false,
      "text": "task_struct {\n    pid\n\n    mm_struct  mm  (memory space, NULL for kernel threads)\n    mm_struct  *active_mm (points at whatever mm was active before this kernel thread ran)\n\n    files_struct  *files;  (Open files table)\n\n }  ",
