      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "vm_area_struct {\n    unsigned long vm_start (Starting address of VMA - inclusive)\n    unsigned long vm_end.   (Ending address of VMA - exclusive)\n\n    mm_struct * vm_mm     ( Back-pointer to the owning `mm_struct`)\n    pgprot_t vm_page_prot ( Permission bits — the readable/writable/executable flags)\n\n    struct file * vm_file.  (The mapped file, if this is a file-backed VMA (NULL for anonymous) )\n    unsigned long vm_pgoff  (Offset into the file where this mapping starts)\n\n    struct list_head anon_vma_chain (Used in reverse mapping - to be explored further)\n     struct anon_vma *anon_vma        \n}\n    \n    ",
      "autoResize": true,
