      "text": "vfsmount {\n    struct dentry *mnt_root (The dentry representing the directory that acts as the root of this specific mount)\n    struct super_block *mnt_sb (A pointer to the physical file system's Superblock.)\n    int mnt_flags (A bitmask controlling the specific security and operational behaviors enforced at the mount level. Common flags: MNT_READONLY, MNT_NOSUID, MNT_NODEV)\n}   ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "vfsmount {\n    struct dentry *mnt_root (The dentry representing the directory that acts as the root of this specific mount)\n    struct super_block *mnt_sb (A pointer to the physical file system's Superblock.)\n    int mnt_flags (A bitmask controlling the specific security and operational behaviors enforced at the mount level. Common flags: MNT_READONLY, MNT_NOSUID, MNT_NODEV)\n}   ",
