      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "inode {\n   u64 i_ino  (This is the absolute, unique serial number assigned to a specific file or directory by the underlying filesystem)\n   atomic_t i_count (Reference count — same `_refcount` discipline from `struct page`. Inode isn't freed while this is nonzero)\n   unsigned int i_nlink (Number of hard links)\n\n   kuid_t  i_uid \n   kgid_t i_gid\n   umode_t i_mode\n\n    const struct inode_operations  *i_op (Pointer to inode operations table)\n    struct super_block *i_sb (Pointer to superblock object for this filesystem)\n    struct address_space  *i_mapping (Pointer to address_space object for this file)\n    struct file_operations * i_fop \n\n     loff_t  i_size (File size in bytes)\n     blkcnt_t i_blocks (Number of blocks of the file)\n    \n}\n\n\n\n\n \n\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "inode {\n   u64 i_ino  (This is the absolute, unique serial number assigned to a specific file or directory by the underlying filesystem)\n   atomic_t i_count (Reference count — same `_refcount` discipline from `struct page`. Inode isn't freed while this is nonzero)\n   unsigned int i_nlink (Number of hard links)\n\n   kuid_t  i_uid \n   kgid_t i_gid\n   umode_t i_mode\n\n    const struct inode_operations  *i_op (Pointer to inode operations table)\n    struct super_block *i_sb (Pointer to superblock object for this filesystem)\n    struct address_space  *i_mapping (Pointer to address_space object for this file)\n    struct file_operations * i_fop \n\n     loff_t  i_size (File size in bytes)\n     blkcnt_t i_blocks (Number of blocks of the file)\n    \n}\n\n\n\n\n \n\n",
